720e2dd7e00775c56f4ac9acd716b2f2f832776f72eb456107d8d916cd10a1cd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Redhead Donut","source_tag":"_t","target":"红色圆胡子"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0d4bfb02a998acf330be99dd40e4d35cc1b999d42f4e3100748b102566976e74","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"637f7b7f376be500a91e41839121771d2e9ea913f0a2872e5971adbe2c6cf012","logical_entry_identity":"cb33263b28135296574165de477fb0355a29699adec8d55916bd77513794da10","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Icons size","source_tag":"_t","target":"图标大小"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bf8368fdf8ba6bad6cbc8b66cecf91bd11b85c9884e10cf1824987f06a09dc21","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6383c611c5c8aef9638a936db8c5895323773f52cb2473c5844095458ca5ad4f","logical_entry_identity":"a2d8adce4e3aa1a8844da6652eefd711471fb07ce6cd3d805b6c02305883544d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Toggle:","source_tag":"_t","target":"切换："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a29c03a38b6bb9bceab2a2b3af7aef5b8818b61e31c8330f4295d030be5a7171","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6384d445e3d72865ec96255bca496e49bc189a3a50054d8ebe3b1d9f8a587aa3","logical_entry_identity":"e3a73de9011acf1d4a33816a0a83117206c236662404f698af7ab8baabdceccc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"During your adventures you will encounter a variety of terrains you can pass on: grass, sand, water, lava, ...\n\nSome of those terrains have innate penalties or tricks. You will have to learn them and how to deal with them.\n\nYou are about to enter a pond of water; you will not be able to breath inside. When you are in an area where you cannot breathe, an \"Air\" counter will appear on the left side of the screen. Do not let it reach zero or you will die.\n\nNow go to the other side of the pond.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"在你的冒险旅途中，你将遇到各种可以通行的地形：草地、沙地、水域、熔岩……\n\n其中一些地形带有天生的惩罚或机制。你必须了解它们并学会如何应对。\n\n你即将进入一片水池；你在水中将无法呼吸。当你处于无法呼吸的区域时，屏幕左侧会出现一个“空气”计数器。切勿让它归零，否则你将会死亡。\n\n现在前往水池的另一侧吧。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d6bf5cfe735362f16e52d92d7f7835eb005b86b7e0a29e69fd30ff22c1e74a95","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6385b660dafd6b41a17ad302c70f9574b88c5ac0727b414b1fdf8f536d22ce3f","logical_entry_identity":"8d63db65c5b6ec1ae7810b36e88c2b9942c024b94da186504eb5956c81976240","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dismissal","source_tag":"talent name","target":"唯我论：豁免"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6c947d7dd746d995dc1ff3e7827685b66a1421f9d95be838a3bdd507986e8654","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6388adb0e533a9c2b1847f6ae3042de1d4a81707f37c58265902a57ba4ea4bed","logical_entry_identity":"1d48ba91caa09ba245a69b2c2b9b16d068c5b1c5a965559f494f0b7ee3ac8a6b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"They're creatures of pure flame, and likely of extraplanar origin, but the ash of objects consumed by their fire has remarkable properties.","source_tag":"_t","target":"它们是由纯粹的火焰组成的生物，似乎来自另一个世界。然而，由它们的火焰燃烧成的灰烬有着非凡的功效。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eb2f62547917a223830fd8c10ff53203e0d1a6cdcaaa3afd0430652a9f13c6b1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"638c2fe57a841d48443a1efdd0735067a4e724251bd4a59324de104c372c1e35","logical_entry_identity":"48a35502873268f87ec5339bd040a2c10b12ecda91c12b48e47b262972b6f40a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have discovered Zigur, the bastion of Nature fighting against all arcane magics.\nMagic has caused so much pain and suffering on the world, it needs to stop.\n\nAll your new characters will now be able to betray arcane escort quests to send them to Zigur, granting new, different, rewards.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"你发现了伊格，一个对抗所有奥术力量的自然堡垒。\n魔法给世界带来了如此多的痛苦与苦难，必须让它停止。\n\n现在，你的所有新角色都可以背叛奥术护送任务，将护送对象送往伊格，从而获得新的、不同的奖励。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3bd4c335b0ca99a3118de3316bee7264d947e38a5291ac1716d25626aaf49071","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"639271a3f2add70a07162c0aad1cf24370cad60dfd4157daea91948494bd065e","logical_entry_identity":"4ce89fc854c73803f15794954b22498ee9f6bca74464c41e7ddff3f398ea0a9a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# is no longer evading attacks.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#不再躲闪攻击。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"50a949e5d84a6f0763e710906a9b13eb1405f7ba2caa1b03a5123e3dd6224d57","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"639355d49a2eda5f85f5b9e0fe37639d0d16642e1874bd133c0f22e43fc90df8","logical_entry_identity":"45cf93f3c70b12ba6fbbc7ae341dbb49c04fca7c27d74241939b4dab0f379994","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"They possess the #GOLD#Luck of the Little Folk#WHITE# which allows them to increase their critical strike chance and saves for a few turns.","source_tag":"_t","target":"他们天生掌握 #GOLD#小不点的幸运#WHITE# 技能，可以使他们在几个回合内提高暴击几率和豁免。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9b432456ea01487ccd665f197f6ed4ebdb148c0dcc11853a4d202a0366c9b802","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"63972fd88fe764be2c1b49a2e845b11135cc86885c958a5e416e66f45442c4a9","logical_entry_identity":"c447b956c6cf7bf1ee7e410397531148ecc8d88e5d3db2b42a4d67ca34719b80","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s will not be automatically used.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%s 不会被自动使用。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"06b2d4d558393094bfa386db42c94cd4622738a001cfb4174f927227ed4cf86a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"639d83786013fda5ef38d6177d5c141b1bb1fe91c033eb725ba9d895ef106c22","logical_entry_identity":"c4f1a66de24ad4ff729ed79d136c8174222dfb4a7d18b2decbf6b29bfa67c0f8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"mindcraft","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"心灵锻造"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5d14a253db5d8039e29c36e1122f3760f283015ba9a4c1c0cedd67f3612046bf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"639f0d7ece8f80bcd4ecfde3d90e91b1bb61fb244e2282e4cbb169aa69e8cc5a","logical_entry_identity":"2799db49c81469e770480e1e6e59623b2fd2da54082241d072929e669101fde1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Arena Battler 20","source_tag":"achievement name","target":"竞技场20波"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"70b9e0f785b7a2863615446d24e6d3e686df718086eb7a75c9e9a555b21344a4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"63a15cd4ac301cad15ff8f9fdef824bc2aa5bdb5385b1c62c860b07960322575","logical_entry_identity":"7b635e5340605120908df83075950d641103cbd91d98964aa16f69705b360795","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"frozen and shattered into a million little shards","source_tag":"_t","target":"被冰冻后碎裂为数百万冰晶"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0ff62db7e1f51123b67703815769cd03f6e872b91ac64b4dc3ea1f330d7eb75a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"63a2ade5e851c29b4fc20ce4b69e422f8f1cbed317b17d9f6f3c5461ea13679f","logical_entry_identity":"251e3914815e11c0e80287f83b9312baf6f5621d1e067cb557f82aeed8f6bff5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Surround yourself with a shield that will absorb %d%% of any lightning/blight/darkness/mind attack, up to a maximum of %d damage per attack.\n\t\tEvery time your shield absorbs damage, you convert some of the attack into energy, gaining one point of Psi, plus an additional point for every %0.1f points of damage absorbed, up to a maximum %0.1f points each turn.\n\t\tAt talent level 3, when you de-activate the shield twice the absorbed damage (if any) in the last 3 turns is released as a full psionic shield (absorbing all damage).\n\t\tThe maximum amount of damage your shield can absorb and the efficiency of the psi gain scale with your mindpower.\n\t\tYou can only have two of these shields active at once.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用护盾环绕自己，吸收 %d%% 闪电、枯萎、暗影、精神伤害，每次最多吸收 %d 伤害。\n\t\t每次你的护盾吸收伤害时，将部分攻击转化为能量，获得 1 点灵能值；每吸收 %0.1f 点伤害，还会额外获得 1 点灵能值，每回合最多获得 %0.1f 点灵能值。\n\t\t技能等级达到 3 时，关闭护盾会将此前 3 回合吸收的伤害（若有）的两倍转化为一个全效灵能护盾（吸收所有伤害）。\n\t\t护盾每次最多能吸收的伤害以及获得灵能值的效率随精神强度提高。\n\t\t你同时只能维持两个此类护盾。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5bc343ad1c438902248215019d3133085e2fc0379a0e14fede60f718c31fe626","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"63a76d561a606635413f75a0256b09c307b64e2ea4bbb8269c6c7e76b1bf1449","logical_entry_identity":"52f8290a7d816926c6d3ac960d9f3ebd7d5ae99772e0728e4991fd24ed513a04","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Melee retaliation","source_tag":"talent name","target":"近战报复"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fd736c38a08072807cea92a310505100bab632404d6a401665fbbb951e49fc63","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"63a84ddffbd56fd344ca5ee541020da38217b688d64aeb67b9f33e3ca95caf46","logical_entry_identity":"d0abff5bd7a48a20223e5ded3eb78d3440bf3c9fad743ce6569234b6941903d3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You mix together your munitions, leading to powerful new effects:\nIncendiary - Targets struck by the explosion have their armor and saves reduced by %d for 3 turns, and your physical and fire penetration is increased by %d%%.\nVenomous - Shots deal an additional %d%% weapon damage as nature in a radius %d ball, which applies numbing poison as per Exotic Munitions. This cannot occur more than once per turn.\nPiercing - Shots deal %0.2f physical damage and maim the target, bleeding them for a further %0.2f physical damage over 5 turns and reducing all damage dealt by %d%%.\nThe physical damage dealt, armor penetration and save reduction will increase with your Physical Power.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"混合你的弹药，造成更强力的效果：\n燃烧弹- 受到爆炸袭击的目标护甲和豁免减少 %d 持续 3 回合，你的物理和火焰穿透增加 %d%%.\n剧毒弹- 造成 %d%% 自然武器伤害，伤害半径 %d，并施加麻痹毒素效果。每回合最多生效一次。\n穿甲弹- 造成 %0.2f 物理伤害并使目标流血，5 回合内造成 %0.2f 物理伤害并减少他们造成的伤害 %d%%.\n物理伤害、护甲和豁免削减受物理强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eddff660695c5e496cb4d20ca6e945fa5da85f28cdb7839fbf2037f9361b6b28","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"63af03498584ac53e37460f4e64dde09aab4f883dfc110c46a881f21a6564d80","logical_entry_identity":"27823f365b8330263f9fb80c211866ea8df5fffd8fda1d5198823ce3cc46b4b8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A Human warrior, clad in shining plate armour. Power radiates from him.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一位身披闪亮板甲的人类战士。力量从他身上散发出来。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"624b955f71f4d5ed3eea